    output: 'If the police are not registering your FIR, the relevant legal area is criminal procedure. Submit a written application to the SHO and keep a copy. Then complain in writing to the SP or DSP of the area, apply to the Sessions Judge as Ex-Officio Justice of Peace under Sections 22-A/22-B CrPC (who can direct the SHO to register the FIR), or file a private complaint before a Magistrate under Section 200 CrPC.',
